From: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
Subject: MAINTAINERS: cover the page allocator GFP API wrapper
Date: Sun, 01 Nov 2026 18:30:41 -0800

Cover the GFP API wrapper and page-freeing test under PAGE ALLOCATOR. The
allocation/free initialization test exercises both page and slab allocators
and vmalloc(), so assign it to PAGE ALLOCATOR, SLAB ALLOCATOR and VMALLOC.

Add the following file assignments:

MEMORY MANAGEMENT - PAGE ALLOCATOR
        include/linux/gfp_api.h
        lib/test_free_pages.c
        lib/test_meminit.c

MEMORY MANAGEMENT - SLAB ALLOCATOR
        lib/test_meminit.c

MEMORY MANAGEMENT - VMALLOC
        lib/test_meminit.c

Signed-off-by: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
Cc: Vlastimil Babka <vbabka@kernel.org>
Cc: Johannes Weiner <hannes@cmpxchg.org>
